Toolbench bundles the following third-party open-source libraries. Each is
loaded only by the specific tools that need it, and runs entirely in the
visitor's browser.

- pdf-lib            — MIT      — https://github.com/Hopding/pdf-lib
- pdfjs-dist         — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
- fflate             — MIT      — https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate
- yaml               — ISC      — https://github.com/eemeli/yaml
- diff               — BSD-3-Clause — https://github.com/kpdecker/jsdiff
- marked             — MIT      — https://github.com/markedjs/marked
- qrcode-generator   — MIT      — https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator
- jsqr               — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/cozmo/jsQR
- cronstrue          — MIT      — https://github.com/bradymholt/cronstrue
- @huggingface/transformers — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js
- onnxruntime-web     — MIT      — https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

Model weights are downloaded at runtime from the Hugging Face Hub only for
models on the reviewed, permissively-licensed allow-list in
`src/lib/ml/licenses.ts`; they are not redistributed with the site.

Build-time only (not shipped to visitors): astro, tailwindcss, typescript,
vitest, playwright, eslint, prettier.

Full licence texts are in the corresponding node_modules/<pkg>/LICENSE files.
